{"seq":6,"slug":"lc0034-find-first-and-last-position","title":"LeetCode 34 在排序数组中查找元素的第一个和最后一个位置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0034-find-first-and-last-position","wordCount":787,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-34-在排序数组中查找元素的第一个和最后一个位置\">LeetCode 34 在排序数组中查找元素的第一个和最后一个位置</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个按照非递减顺序排列的整数数组 <code>nums</code>，和一个目标值 <code>target</code>。请你找出给定目标值在数组中的开始位置和结束位置。</p>\n<p>如果数组中不存在目标值 <code>target</code>，返回 <code>[-1, -1]</code>。</p>\n<p>你必须设计并实现时间复杂度为 <code>O(log n)</code> 的算法解决此问题。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 10^5</code></li>\n<li><code>-10^9 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10^9</code></li>\n<li><code>nums</code> 是一个非递减数组</li>\n<li><code>-10^9 &lt;= target &lt;= 10^9</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [5, 7, 7, 8, 8, 10], target = 8&#10;输出：[3, 4]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [5, 7, 7, 8, 8, 10], target = 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[3, 4]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [5, 7, 7, 8, 8, 10], target = 6&#10;输出：[-1, -1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [5, 7, 7, 8, 8, 10], target = 6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[-1, -1]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [], target = 0&#10;输出：[-1, -1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [], target = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[-1, -1]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题考察的是二分查找中最重要的变体——<strong>查找左边界和右边界</strong>。标准二分查找在找到目标后就返回，而边界二分需要在找到目标后继续搜索以确定边界位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"问题分解\">问题分解</h3><p>将问题分解为两个子问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>查找 target 的<strong>左边界</strong>（第一个等于 target 的位置）</li>\n<li>查找 target 的<strong>右边界</strong>（最后一个等于 target 的位置）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>每个子问题都可以用一次二分查找在 O(log n) 内解决。</p>\n<h3 id=\"左边界二分\">左边界二分</h3><p>查找左边界时，当 <code>nums[mid] === target</code>，不能立即返回。因为 mid 左边可能还有等于 target 的元素。应该继续向左搜索：<code>right = mid - 1</code>。当搜索结束时，<code>left</code> 就是左边界（如果 target 存在的话）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"右边界二分\">右边界二分</h3><p>查找右边界时，当 <code>nums[mid] === target</code>，应该继续向右搜索：<code>left = mid + 1</code>。当搜索结束时，<code>right</code> 就是右边界。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种二分模式对比\">三种二分模式对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th><code>nums[mid] === target</code> 时</th>\n<th>返回值</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准二分</td>\n<td>直接返回 mid</td>\n<td>任意一个位置</td>\n<td>精确查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>左边界二分</td>\n<td><code>right = mid - 1</code></td>\n<td>left</td>\n<td>第一个 ≥ target</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>右边界二分</td>\n<td><code>left = mid + 1</code></td>\n<td>right</td>\n<td>最后一个 ≤ target</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"统一模板-lower_bound-和-upper_bound\">统一模板：lower_bound 和 upper_bound</h3><p>另一种思路是借鉴 C++ 的 <code>lower_bound</code> 和 <code>upper_bound</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>lower_bound(target)</code> 返回第一个 ≥ target 的位置</li>\n<li><code>upper_bound(target)</code> 返回第一个 &gt; target 的位置</li>\n</ul>\n<p>那么 target 的范围就是 <code>[lower_bound(target), upper_bound(target) - 1]</code>。而 <code>upper_bound(target)</code> 等于 <code>lower_bound(target + 1)</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"两次二分法-推荐\">两次二分法（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function searchRange(nums: number[], target: number): number[] {&#10;  const left = findLeft(nums, target);&#10;  const right = findRight(nums, target);&#10;  return [left, right];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function findLeft(nums: number[], target: number): number {&#10;  let lo = 0;&#10;  let hi = nums.length - 1;&#10;  let result = -1;&#10;&#10;  while (lo &lt;= hi) {&#10;    const mid = lo + Math.floor((hi - lo) / 2);&#10;&#10;    if (nums[mid] === target) {&#10;      result = mid;&#10;      hi = mid - 1;&#10;    } else if (nums[mid] &lt; target) {&#10;      lo = mid + 1;&#10;    } else {&#10;      hi = mid - 1;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function findRight(nums: number[], target: number): number {&#10;  let lo = 0;&#10;  let hi = nums.length - 1;&#10;  let result = -1;&#10;&#10;  while (lo &lt;= hi) {&#10;    const mid = lo + Math.floor((hi - lo) / 2);&#10;&#10;    if (nums[mid] === target) {&#10;      result = mid;&#10;      lo = mid + 1;&#10;    } else if (nums[mid] &lt; target) {&#10;      lo = mid + 1;&#10;    } else {&#10;      hi = mid - 1;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> searchRange</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findLeft</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nums, target);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findRight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nums, target);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [left, right];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findLeft</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (lo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hi) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((hi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lo) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[mid] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      hi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[mid] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      lo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">